<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan to auction Federal Investment Bonds.</title>
<headline>Pakistan to auction Federal Investment Bonds.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said on Wednesday it had invited tenders by Saturday for the auction of the government's Federal Investment Bonds.</p>
<p>The auction result will be announced on Saturday and deposits accepted on Monday, a bank statement said. &quot;Bids can be rejected without assigning any reason,&quot; it added.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
